# VoxAvatar agent entrypoint

Follow `AGENTS.md` as the single source of truth for every AI agent. Thin entry files `CLAUDE.md` and `SKILL.md` only point at `AGENTS.md`. Work autonomously, preserve existing user changes, finish all stated requirements, verify with `npm run check`, review affected documentation, update SemVer and CHANGELOG, then commit and push `main`.

Do not ask about routine decisions already covered by `AGENTS.md` or `docs/DECISIONS.md`. Never cross the Windows-only, audio-privacy, loopback-only, media-licensing, or upstream-attribution boundaries. Tags and Releases are batch-cut according to `docs/RELEASING.md`; do not create empty releases.
